From e001aba208a2598bc47bd5c1a0723604c9ba6beb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 19:57:56 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Modernize dotfiles for Neovim 0.12 and switch to Monofur Nerd
 Font

Neovim
- LSP: native vim.lsp.config/enable; mason-org repos; drop dead
  mason-lspconfig v1 handlers and the misspelled capabilities variable
- LSP keymaps follow 0.11+ defaults (grr/gri/grt/gO) instead of gr/gI
- nvim-treesitter + textobjects on the `main` branch; ]f/[f/]F/[F jumps
  replace the conflicting [d/]d/[[/]] maps
- Single nvim-mini/mini.nvim spec; mini.ai and mini.jump were never set up
- mini.ai provides af/if/aa/ia via tree-sitter
- copilot.lua replaces the copilot.vim augroup workaround
- conform: prettierd with prettier fallback, goimports only
- Remove default/duplicate options, vim.loop, vim.highlight

tmux: XDG path, terminal-features for Alacritty, drop settings
tmux-sensible already covers, consistent Nord borders
Alacritty: Monofur Nerd Font Mono, option_as_alt for tmux Alt bindings
Repo: untrack Karabiner backups, trim .gitignore, README, Brewfile

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017PRP6gF7nrDQs1FigfJ2Ve
